    <p>Automnia AI Nexus v1.0.31 is ready. Pick the installer that matches your computer.</p>
    <div class="automnia-downloads__notice" role="note">
      <strong>Before you install</strong>
      <p>These installers are currently unsigned, so your computer may show a security warning. Download only from this page, confirm the file name matches the one below, and follow the steps for your operating system. You never need to turn off your computer’s security protections.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="automnia-downloads__grid">
    <article class="automnia-downloads__card">
      <div class="automnia-downloads__title">
        <span class="automnia-downloads__platform">Windows</span>
        <h3>Windows 64-bit</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="automnia-downloads__details">
        <p>Installer for current Windows PCs.</p>
        <details>
          <summary>How to install on Windows</summary>
          <ol>
            <li>Download <code>Automnia-Setup-x64.exe</code>, then open it from your Downloads folder.</li>
            <li>If Windows shows “Windows protected your PC,” select <strong>More info</strong>, verify the file name, then select <strong>Run anyway</strong>.</li>
            <li>Select <strong>Yes</strong> if Windows asks whether Automnia can make changes to install the app, then follow the installer prompts.</li>
          </ol>
          <p class="automnia-downloads__safety">Do not disable Microsoft Defender or change Windows security settings. If the file name or download source is different, cancel the installation.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
      <a href="{{ downloads_base_url }}Automnia-Setup-x64.exe" download>Download <span>.exe</span></a>
    </article>

    <article class="automnia-downloads__card">
      <div class="automnia-downloads__title">
        <span class="automnia-downloads__platform">macOS</span>
        <h3>Apple silicon</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="automnia-downloads__details">
        <p>For Macs with M-series chips.</p>
        <details>
          <summary>How to install on an Apple silicon Mac</summary>
          <ol>
            <li>Open <code>Automnia-AI-Nexus-arm64.dmg</code>, then drag Automnia AI Nexus into the <strong>Applications</strong> folder.</li>
            <li>Open <strong>Applications</strong> in Finder, Control-click Automnia AI Nexus, choose <strong>Open</strong>, then choose <strong>Open</strong> again.</li>
            <li>If macOS still blocks it, go to <strong>System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security</strong>, scroll to the Security section, and select <strong>Open Anyway</strong> for Automnia AI Nexus. Confirm only after checking the app name.</li>
          </ol>
          <p class="automnia-downloads__safety">You do not need to allow apps from anywhere or disable Gatekeeper. If Automnia later requests a privacy permission for a feature, enable only that specific permission in Privacy &amp; Security.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
      <a href="{{ downloads_base_url }}Automnia-AI-Nexus-arm64.dmg" download>Download <span>.dmg</span></a>
    </article>

