          <ol>
            <li>Download <code>Automnia-AI-Nexus-x86_64.AppImage</code>.</li>
            <li>Right-click the file, open <strong>Properties → Permissions</strong>, and allow the file to run as a program.</li>
            <li>Double-click the file to open Automnia. If your file manager does not offer that option, use <code>chmod +x Automnia-AI-Nexus-x86_64.AppImage</code> in a terminal, then open the file.</li>
          </ol>
